<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="format-detection" content="telephone=no">
    <meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
    <!--[if mso]>
    <noscript>
        <xml>
            <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
                <o:AllowPNG/>
                <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>
            </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>
        </xml>
    </noscript>
    <![endif]-->
    <title>セミナーのご案内</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border: 1px solid #cccccc;
        }
        /* Outlook-specific width constraints for consistent rendering */
        table.container-table {
            width: 600px !important;
            max-width: 600px !important;
            table-layout: fixed !important;
            margin: 0 auto !important;
            border-collapse: collapse !important;
            mso-table-lspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-wrap: none !important;
        }
        /* Enhanced Outlook compatibility with MSO properties */
        table.mso-table {
            mso-table-lspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;
            border-collapse: collapse !important;
            table-layout: fixed !important;
            margin: 0 auto !important;
            mso-table-wrap: none !important;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            padding-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #cccccc;
        }
        .recipient-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #000000;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        .seminar-title {
            color: #000000;
            margin: 30px 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-align: center;
            line-height: 1.3;
            padding: 20px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            border: 3px solid #000000;
            background: #ffffff;
        }
        .seminar-details {
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px;
            border: 2px solid #000000;
            margin: 30px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .detail-label {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #000000;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            margin-top: 25px;
            display: block;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000000;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .detail-label:first-child {
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        .date-time {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .start-time {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .venue-info {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 18px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            margin: 15px 0;
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .speaker-section {
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .speaker-bio {
            margin-top: 15px;
            padding: 15px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #cccccc;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .info-notice {
            margin: 30px 0;
            padding: 25px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #000000;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        .notice-text {
            margin: 0;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 17px;
        }
        .notice-detail {
            margin: 12px 0 0 0;
            color: #000000;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 28px;
            margin: 10px 8px 10px 0;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: #000000;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #666666;
            border: 1px solid #666666;
        }
        .btn-danger {
            background: #000000;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
        }
        .btn-danger:hover {
            background: #666666;
            border: 1px solid #666666;
        }
        .btn-warning {
            background: #666666;
            color: white;
            border: 1px solid #666666;
        }
        .btn-warning:hover {
            background: #000000;
            border: 1px solid #000000;
        }
        .button-container {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 40px 0;
            padding: 25px 15px;
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 2px solid #000000;
            border-radius: 8px;
            /* Enhanced Outlook-specific properties */
            mso-table-lspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;
        }
        /* Simplified button container table - reduced width for better Outlook compatibility */
        .button-container table {
            width: 300px !important;
            max-width: 300px !important;
            margin: 0 auto !important;
            border-collapse: collapse !important;
            table-layout: fixed !important;
            mso-table-lspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-wrap: none !important;
            border: 0 !important;
        }
        /* Enhanced button cell styling for Outlook compatibility - smaller cells */
        .button-container td {
            width: 100px !important;
            max-width: 100px !important;
            text-align: center !important;
            vertical-align: middle !important;
            padding: 3px !important;
            mso-table-lspace: 0pt !important;
            mso-table-rspace: 0pt !important;
            border: 0 !important;
        }
        /* Improved Outlook button link styling - smaller buttons */
        .button-container a {
            display: block !important;
            text-decoration: none !important;
            mso-hide: none !important;
            font-size: 12px !important;
            padding: 8px 4px !important;
            mso-padding-alt: 8px 4px 8px 4px !important;
            width: 92px !important;
            max-width: 92px !important;
            margin: 0 auto !important;
            box-sizing: border-box !important;
            mso-border-alt: none !important;
        }
        .button-instruction {
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #000000;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .fallback-links {
            margin-top: 35px;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid #cccccc;
        }
        .fallback-text {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #000000;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-style: italic;
        }
        .fallback-links ul {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #000000;
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        .fallback-links li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .fallback-links a {
            color: #000000;
            word-break: break-all;
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .container {
                padding: 25px 20px;
                margin: 10px;
                border-radius: 8px;
                width: 100% !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
            }
            /* Outlook mobile adjustments */
            table.container-table {
                width: 100% !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
            }
            .seminar-title {
                font-size: 20px;
                padding: 10px;
            }
            .seminar-details {
                padding: 20px;
            }
            .btn {
                display: block;
                margin: 12px 0;
                padding: 18px;
                font-size: 16px;
            }
            .button-container {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }
            .venue-info, .speaker-section {
                padding: 15px;
            }
        }
        /* Outlook-specific fixes */
        @media screen and (-webkit-min-device-pixel-ratio: 0) {
            .container {
                max-width: 600px !important;
            }
        }
        
        /* Mobile-first responsive approach for all email clients including Outlook */
        @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            table.container-table {
                width: 100% !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
                min-width: 320px !important;
            }
            .container {
                width: 100% !important;
                max-width: 100% !important;
                padding: 20px !important;
            }
            .button-container table {
                width: 100% !important;
                max-width: 270px !important;
            }
            .button-container td {
                width: 33.33% !important;
                max-width: 90px !important;
                padding: 2px !important;
            }
            /* Outlook mobile specific button adjustments - smaller buttons */
            .button-container a {
                font-size: 11px !important;
                padding: 8px 2px !important;
                display: block !important;
                width: 86px !important;
                max-width: 86px !important;
            }
        }
        
        /* Desktop and tablet view for Outlook */
        @media screen and (min-width: 601px) {
            table.container-table {
                width: 600px !important;
                max-width: 600px !important;
            }
            .button-container table {
                width: 300px !important;
                max-width: 300px !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <!--[if mso]>
    <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="600" align="center" style="margin: 0 auto; width: 600px; max-width: 600px; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
        <tr>
            <td align="center" style="width: 600px; padding: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <![endif]-->
    <div class="container">
        <!--[if mso]>
        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="100%" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
            <tr>
                <td style="padding: 40px; width: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
        <![endif]-->
        <div class="header">
            <p class="recipient-name">{{ recipient.name }} 様</p>
        </div>
        
        <h2 class="seminar-title">{{ seminar.title }}</h2>
        
        <div class="seminar-details">
            <strong class="detail-label">日時</strong><br>
            <div class="date-time">{{ seminar.date | japanese_date if seminar.date else '日時未定' }}</div>
            {% if formatted_seminar.open_time or formatted_seminar.end_time %}
            {% if formatted_seminar.open_time %}<div style="margin: 8px 0; color: #000000; font-weight: 500;">開場: {{ formatted_seminar.open_time }}</div>{% endif %}
            {% endif %}
            {% if seminar.date %}
            <div class="start-time">{{ seminar.date | japanese_time }}開始</div>
            {% endif %}
            {% if formatted_seminar.end_time %}<div style="margin: 8px 0; color: #000000; font-weight: 500;">終了: {{ formatted_seminar.end_time }}</div>{% endif %}
            <br>
            
            <strong class="detail-label">開催場所</strong><br>
            <div class="venue-info">
                {{ seminar.venue | replace('\n', '<br>') | safe if seminar.venue else '会場未定' }}
            </div>
            
            {% if seminar.speaker or formatted_seminar.speaker_bio %}
            <strong class="detail-label">ゲストスピーカー</strong><br>
            <div class="speaker-section">
                {% if seminar.speaker %}
                {{ seminar.speaker | replace('\n', '<br>') | safe }}
                {% endif %}
                {% if formatted_seminar.speaker_bio %}
                <div class="speaker-bio">
                    {{ formatted_seminar.speaker_bio | replace('\n', '<br>') | safe }}
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if formatted_seminar.description or seminar.topic %}
            <strong class="detail-label">詳細情報</strong><br>
            <div class="venue-info">
                {% if formatted_seminar.description %}
                {{ formatted_seminar.description | replace('\n', '<br>') | safe }}
                {% else %}
                {{ seminar.topic | replace('\n', '<br>') | safe }}
                {% endif %}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            
            {% if seminar.contact %}
            <strong class="detail-label">お問い合わせ</strong><br>
            <div class="venue-info">
                {{ seminar.contact | replace('\n', '<br>') | safe }}
            </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>
        
        <div class="info-notice">
            <p class="notice-text">当日は軽食をご用意しています。</p>
            <p class="notice-detail">講演後に質疑応答/ディスカッションを予定していますので、発言される際はお名前と現在の所属/役職もお願いします。</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="button-container">
            <p class="button-instruction">以下のボタンから出欠をご回答ください。</p>
            
            <!--[if mso]>
            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="300" align="center" style="width: 300px; margin: 0 auto; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; mso-table-wrap: none;">
                <tr>
                    <td width="100" align="center" valign="middle" style="width: 100px; padding: 3px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="92" align="center" style="width: 92px; margin: 0 auto; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#000000" style="background-color: #000000; padding: 8px 4px; mso-padding-alt: 8px 4px 8px 4px; border: 1px solid #000000;">
                                    <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=attend" style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: block; mso-hide: none;">出席</a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td width="100" align="center" valign="middle" style="width: 100px; padding: 3px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="92" align="center" style="width: 92px; margin: 0 auto; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#000000" style="background-color: #000000; padding: 8px 4px; mso-padding-alt: 8px 4px 8px 4px; border: 1px solid #000000;">
                                    <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=absent" style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: block; mso-hide: none;">欠席</a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                    <td width="100" align="center" valign="middle" style="width: 100px; padding: 3px; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                        <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" width="92" align="center" style="width: 92px; margin: 0 auto; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
                            <tr>
                                <td align="center" valign="middle" bgcolor="#666666" style="background-color: #666666; padding: 8px 4px; mso-padding-alt: 8px 4px 8px 4px; border: 1px solid #666666;">
                                    <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=pending" style="color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: block; mso-hide: none;">保留</a>
                                </td>
                            </tr>
                        </table>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <![endif]-->
            <!--[if !mso]><!-- -->
            <table role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 auto; max-width: 300px; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; table-layout: fixed;">
                <tr>
                    <td style="width: 100px; max-width: 100px; padding: 3px; text-align: center;">
                        <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=attend" 
                           style="background-color: #000000; color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 4px; display: block; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 92px; max-width: 92px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto;">出席</a>
                    </td>
                    <td style="width: 100px; max-width: 100px; padding: 3px; text-align: center;">
                        <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=absent" 
                           style="background-color: #000000; color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 4px; display: block; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #000000; width: 92px; max-width: 92px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto;">欠席</a>
                    </td>
                    <td style="width: 100px; max-width: 100px; padding: 3px; text-align: center;">
                        <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=pending" 
                           style="background-color: #666666; color: white; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; padding: 8px 4px; display: block; text-align: center; border: 1px solid #666666; width: 92px; max-width: 92px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0 auto;">保留</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            <!--<![endif]-->
        </div>
        
        <div class="fallback-links">
            <p class="fallback-text">
                ※ ボタンが機能しない場合は、以下のリンクをコピーしてブラウザのアドレスバーに貼り付けてください：
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>出席: <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=attend">https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=attend</a></li>
                <li>欠席: <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=absent">https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=absent</a></li>
                <li>保留: <a href="https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=pending">https://seminar-attendance.onrender.com/respond?seminar_id={{ seminar.id }}&recipient_id={{ recipient.id }}&status=pending</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
        <!--[if mso]>
                </td>
            </tr>
        </table>
        <![endif]-->
    </div>
    <!--[if mso]>
            </td>
        </tr>
    </table>
    <![endif]-->
</body>
</html>